      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.285mountainguide.com/directory/communities/grant.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 22‑mile Guanella Pass Road, a National Scenic Byway, climbs above the tree line between Grant and Georgetown.",
